// Front-face paint for the battleweave fighting coat. Cloth (b/m/c) with
// steel seams (e/k). No empty cells. `flow` is how far the hem follows a
// foot — lower than a robe so the skirt stays short. Sleeves run shoulder,
// elbow, then a wrist disk. Top and bottom rows cap the sheet edges.
